title: Rinthel Runtime Architecture
direction: right

Tarkark [icon: user, type: client, label: "Tarkark (user)"]
Browser client [icon: browser]
External LLM [icon: cloud, type: external, label: "External LLM (OpenRouter/Anthropic)", row: 5, col: 4]

Host Machine {
  Rinthel Client [icon: rust, type: frontend, label: "Rinthel Client (Ratatui, rinthel-boot.sh)", row: 1, col: 1]
  Rinthel Daemon [icon: python, label: "Rinthel Daemon (FastAPI, persistent) 127.0.0.1:8765", row: 1, col: 2]
  llama-server [icon: server, label: "llama-server (CUDA) 127.0.0.1:8080", row: 2, col: 2]

  Docker Engine {
    Understory stack {
      Understory [icon: docker, label: "Understory ghcr.io/thecodacus/understory (network_mode: host, :3800)"]
    }

    Pithagoras stack {
      Pithagoras [icon: server, label: "Pithagoras portal (network_mode: host, :4100)"]
      portal-db [icon: sqlite, label: "portal.db (SQLite)"]
      Tailscale [icon: vpn, type: security, label: "Tailscale sidecar (optional)"]

      Voice add-on {
        whisper.cpp [icon: server, label: "whisper.cpp (managed, CPU) :8188"]
        audio.cpp [icon: server, label: "audio.cpp / Breeze-TTS-2 (managed, GPU) :7862"]
      }
    }
  }
}

Tarkark > Rinthel Client: starts (./rinthel-boot.sh, terminal)
Tarkark > Browser client: uses (separate from the TUI)
Rinthel Client <> Rinthel Daemon: HTTP+WS 127.0.0.1:8765 (REST + /ws/monitor)
Rinthel Client > Rinthel Daemon: autostart if not running (pidfile) {style: dashed}
Rinthel Daemon > llama-server: spawns (LocalProcessService) {fromSide: bottom, toSide: top}
Rinthel Daemon > Understory: docker compose up/down {labelDy: 122}
Rinthel Daemon > Pithagoras: docker compose up/down
Browser client > Pithagoras: HTTPS/SSE :4100
Pithagoras > llama-server: HTTP :8080, OpenAI-compatible {fromSide: bottom, toSide: top}
Pithagoras > Understory: MCP :3800, bearer token
Understory > llama-server: HTTP :8080, loopback (host-networked) {labelDy: 47}
Pithagoras > External LLM: fallback (PI_PROVIDER/PI_MODEL) {style: dashed}
Pithagoras > portal-db
Pithagoras > Tailscale {style: dashed}
Pithagoras > whisper.cpp: /inference
Pithagoras > audio.cpp: /v1/audio/speech
